# SUTRAM Cursor Rules

You are assisting on SUTRAM, an AI-powered multimedia forensics platform.
Before generating or modifying any code:
1. Always consult AGENTS.md for architecture boundaries and coding rules.
2. Check the specific teammate assignment in docs/team/ (KARTIKEY.md, SHIVENDRA.md, SAKSHAM.md, SAARIKA.md).
3. Evidence in evidence_store/originals/ is STRICTLY READ-ONLY (ISO/IEC 27037).
4. Never introduce fake, random or ungrounded scores; use status="not_implemented" or deterministic [MOCK] fixtures.
5. All scores must map to the 5-tier calibrated verbal scale.
6. Run `uv run ruff check backend` and `uv run pytest backend/tests` to verify.

